2
00:08:38,181 --> 00:08:44,181
Monster Man is a horror, comedy film directed by Michael Davis.

3
00:12:57,272 --> 00:13:03,272
Two guys and a female hitchhiker are terrorized by a
monstrous looking man driving a giant monster truck.

4
00:17:16,363 --> 00:17:22,363
Adam, played by Eric Jungmann.

5
00:21:35,454 --> 00:21:41,454
Harley, played by Justin Urich.

6
00:25:54,545 --> 00:26:00,545
Sarah, played by Aimee Brooks.

7
